{"title":"ARTbus: Mississauga and Oakville Galleries ($20)","startsAt":"2026-10-24T11:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-24T17:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Can you join us on our next ARTbus ?? !!\n\nWe've been attending these **ARTbus** trips for many years. Not always able to get them posted on MEETUP-as they fill up quite quickly.\n\n$20 ticket link is below.\n\n***Purchase your OWN ticket*** when you RSVP on Meetup.\n\n**In partnership with the Art Gallery of Mississauga, Oakville Galleries invites you to join us for the FALL 2026 ARTbus.**\n\n(We rent a BUS--ok its a **yellow school bus**--but it works!) Hence the $20 price!\n\n**$20 per person** at the *link below. (By signing up--signals to me that you've purchased your $20 ticket--LET me know via Meetup email)*\n\nWould you like to join in this next one/upcoming? **Saturday October 24th. (11am-5:30pm)**\n\nThis will be incredible afternoon!! International artists. Lovely reception and opening comments.\n\n**We'll begin** the afternoon at a Gallery opening at Bloor/Lansdowne, before heading to Mississauga and Oakville\n\nLet someone else DRIVE while we enjoy socializing and ART learning.\n\n**Reserve your own seat ($20)** and enjoy an inspiring afternoon across three leading art institutions.\n\nWe finish the day at Gairloch Gardens--(right on Lake Ontario) and a nice reception for us (wine/cheese)\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/visit\n\n**TICKET link here (with all details)--**\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/artbus_2026_fall\n\nPlease be on TIME. Plan ahead.\n\nYou should be inside the first gallery by 11:15am. BUS will leave at 12 noon.\n\nSee you there.","venue":{"name":"Patel Brown","address":"21 Wade Ave Unit 2, Toronto, ON M6H 1P4, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.658898,"lng":-79.443931,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/6/a/3/highres_451449891.jpeg"}